<title>RUSSIA: Russia's Murmansk Shipping to sell 23.5 pct May 16.</title>
<headline>Russia's Murmansk Shipping to sell 23.5 pct May 16.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Murmansk Shipping Company will offer 23.5 percent of its shares in an investment tender on May 16, the Russian Federal Property Fund said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>No further details of the tender were available.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
